<div class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">A GOOD EXPERIENCE NEEDS A GOOD FOUNDATION</span><h1>A well-run learning space.</h1><p>Honest delivery status, thoughtful community rules and clear operational settings.</p></div><span class="icon-tile blue"><?= icon('settings',24) ?></span></div><div class="admin-settings-grid"><div class="stack"><section class="card form-card"><h2 class="form-section-title">Give learners a way to reach you.</h2><p class="form-section-description">This address appears on the public contact page. No credentials belong in this form.</p><form action="<?= e(route_url('/api/admin/settings')) ?>" method="post" data-api><?= csrfField() ?><div class="field"><label for="support-email">Support email address</label><input id="support-email" name="support_email" type="email" maxlength="190" value="<?= e(setting('support_email','')) ?>" placeholder="support@your-domain.example"></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Save contact settings</button></form></section><section class="card form-card"><h2 class="form-section-title">Thoughtful peer feedback.</h2><p class="form-section-description">Projects are shared only after an owner requests reviews. Self-reviews, duplicate reviews and blocked relationships are excluded.</p><form action="<?= e(route_url('/api/admin/settings')) ?>" method="post" data-api><?= csrfField() ?><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="review-count">Reviews requested per project</label><input id="review-count" name="peer_review_count" type="number" min="1" max="5" value="<?= (int)setting('peer_review_count',2) ?>" required></div><div class="field"><label for="review-lessons">Completed lessons to be eligible</label><input id="review-lessons" name="peer_review_min_lessons" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="<?= (int)setting('peer_review_min_lessons',3) ?>" required></div><div class="field full"><label for="anonymous">Reviewer identity shown to project owners</label><select id="anonymous" name="peer_review_anonymous"><option value="0" <?= !(int)setting('peer_review_anonymous',0)?'selected':'' ?>>Show reviewer name</option><option value="1" <?= (int)setting('peer_review_anonymous',0)?'selected':'' ?>>Anonymous to project owner</option></select></div></div><p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:16px">Reviewers have seven days and at most three open reviews. Moderators can still identify reviewers. Peer feedback never automatically approves assignments.</p><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">Save review rules</button></div></form></section><section class="card card-pad"><h2 style="font-size:17px;margin-bottom:15px">Before opening the doors.</h2><ul class="objective-list"><?php foreach(['Configure HTTPS and production secure cookies.','Set a strong server-side signing key and least-privilege database credentials.','Add SMTP credentials only in the private environment.','Schedule the CLI worker and monitor failed deliveries.','Review legal notices and supply the operator’s identity.','Test an encrypted backup and a full restore.'] as $s): ?><li><?= icon('check-circle',15) ?><span><?= e($s) ?></span></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul></section></div><div class="stack"><section class="card card-pad"><div class="card-header"><h2>What is actually connected.</h2><?= icon('shield',19) ?></div><div class="config-status"><span>Environment</span><?= badge(env('APP_ENV','development')) ?></div><div class="config-status"><span>SMTP email</span><?= badge(\Learnow\Services\MailService::enabled()?'configured':'not_configured') ?></div><div class="config-status"><span>Email verification requirement</span><?= badge(filter_var(env('MAIL_ENABLED'),FILTER_VALIDATE_BOOL)?'enabled':'disabled') ?></div><div class="config-status"><span>Secure cookie flag</span><?= badge(filter_var(env('COOKIE_SECURE'),FILTER_VALIDATE_BOOL)?'enabled':'development_only') ?></div><div class="config-status"><span>In-app notifications</span><?= badge('active') ?></div><div class="config-status"><span>Background push / WhatsApp</span><?= badge('not_configured') ?></div><div class="config-status"><span>Personalisation</span><span class="badge badge-neutral">Rules-based</span></div><p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:18px">API keys, SMTP passwords and JWT secrets are never displayed or edited through a browser. Configure the private environment on the host and restart the PHP service when needed.</p></section><section class="card card-pad"><div class="card-header"><h2>Recurring work, without repeats.</h2><?= icon('clock',19) ?></div><p class="fine-print">Run the CLI job every five minutes. It uses an advisory worker lock, unique notification keys and one report per learner and week.</p><div class="review-response" style="font-size:12px;margin:17px 0;padding:16px">*/5 * * * * cd /path/to/learnow &amp;&amp; /usr/bin/php bin/scheduled-jobs.php</div><div class="key-value"><span>Last successful worker run</span><strong><?= e(setting('last_job_run','Not run yet')) ?><?= setting('last_job_run')?' UTC':'' ?></strong></div><div class="key-value"><span>Weekly reports saved</span><strong><?= number(\Learnow\Repositories\DB::value('SELECT COUNT(*) FROM weekly_reports')) ?></strong></div><?php foreach($mailCounts as $m): ?><div class="key-value"><span>Email queue · <?= e($m['status']) ?></span><strong><?= (int)$m['total'] ?></strong></div><?php endforeach; ?><p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:15px">A “sending” entry left after a crash is held for manual reconciliation, not automatically resent. SMTP cannot guarantee exactly-once delivery.</p></section><div class="notice"><?= icon('info',19) ?><p>This local preview is not a production deployment or an independent security audit. Use the deployment and backup documentation before launch.</p></div></div></div>
